(text "The panel: 1.14in 240x135 ST7789 on an 8-pin 0.5 mm ribbon, one\nseller's pin order (DESIGN.md). Its LEDK is GND inside, so Q2\nswitches LEDA on the high side; GPIO45 high is on, as on the\nFeather. R3 holds GPIO45 (a strap: VDD_SPI) low at reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 185.42 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c47361dc-0953-4ed4-926b-e1e70ba2ef80"))
